cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Graphical Playground in your research, software, or educational
  material, please cite it using the metadata provided in this file.
type: software

title: "Graphical Playground"

abstract: >-
  Graphical Playground is an open-source platform for learning modern graphics
  engineering through hands-on experimentation, software development, and
  deconstructionist pedagogy. It provides an environment for exploring graphics
  programming, engine architecture, and the engineering principles behind
  real-time rendering systems.

